IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INVOICE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRICE   PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 19.99.
01 WS-QTY     PIC 9(3)    VALUE 3.
01 WS-SUBTOTAL PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TAX     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL   PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-NAME    PIC X(20)   VALUE "Widget".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    COMPUTE WS-SUBTOTAL = WS-PRICE * WS-QTY.
    COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-SUBTOTAL * 0.21 ROUNDED.
    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-SUBTOTAL + WS-TAX.
    DISPLAY "Item:     " WS-NAME.
    DISPLAY "Subtotal: " WS-SUBTOTAL.
    DISPLAY "Tax:      " WS-TAX.
    DISPLAY "Total:    " WS-TOTAL.
    IF WS-TOTAL > 50 THEN
        DISPLAY "Status:   premium"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "Status:   standard"
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
